<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pa 1118-199v-3</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/7a610368-ffd3-4c06-a32a-089fdec1fd5f</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Sequenzen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-38876ff8-61ec-42c1-877a-abf21d6c7cc2" endid="#m-b0f96edc-7fb5-4855-9029-35ba6d112c44" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><table><tr><td><rend>((sapiencia)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((sapienciam))</rend></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td><rend>Nach dieser Strophe ist (mit ((AH))) eine Lücke anzunehmen, weil sonst 4a grammatisch und inhaltlich in der Luft hängt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-14a9de65-ec12-4484-bf4b-f4cc9b322235" endid="#m-530c8f63-da9c-4c72-b385-834329de894a"><table><tr><td><rend>((arua siue maria))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>grammatikalisch plausibler: ((arue siue marium)) (wie ((AH))), dagegen spricht die a-Assonanz am Strophenende.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4ec2eea3-2432-44a5-b457-0f702dc272d1" endid="#m-08d43acd-c581-4fa6-a937-8fc84e06f4eb"><table><tr><td><rend>((seua))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((sua))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-b1dc85a4-c377-4bbd-9bcc-46cb0f396875" endid="#m-4d717deb-276d-4e67-8352-76f07ac64db8"><table><tr><td><rend>((homnia))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((omnia))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-62c248d6-2d97-40f6-9b3d-cf91d008d37f" endid="#m-71f96c7e-a903-406b-b691-ed3df426b941"><table><tr><td><rend>((holim))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((olim))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-6183c85e-34ff-46c2-884f-799eb1fb5cd8" endid="#m-86783698-3dd7-47ae-b62f-f30889915a5b" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((houem))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((horiuem)), lies ((ouem)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c4cb8c85-552a-42ad-987e-8a855e97e720" endid="#m-20af05f5-c0fa-492c-b865-f676b6e78e7b" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((sexus)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((secus))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-14083bd3-4cbf-4f2a-b174-083d54746adf" endid="#m-ce44089c-4f34-4322-b60e-9c6f0244f3cb"><table><tr><td><rend>((peraudi))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Das Wort ((peraudire)) ist zwar belegt, aber sehr selten; da hier ((laus)) alleine steht und die Strophe kürzer ist als 8a, wäre zu vermuten, dass ((per)) das Fragment eines Wortes ist, etwa ((perennis)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1118"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1118</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1118-199v-3</identifier><title>Alme deus rex</title><incip><incipText><p>Alme deus rex</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="199v">f. 199v, l. 3</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 7, 264</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Sequenz</term><term type="genre">Textiert</term><term type="Editor">Andreas Pfisterer</term><term type="Endseite">200</term><term type="Endzeile">8</term><term type="Zusatz_zu_Textinitium">Ohne Notation